 * Single-file standalone code. No Index.html needed!
 * Fixes:
 * 1. F5 Number Fix (Strict Number parsing to avoid string concatenation like 53 Billion)
 * 2. Active/Inactive Status Filter in Master Ledger
 * 3. Add Row in Bulk Entry Form
 * 4. Excel-Type Filters for Loans (All rows/columns)
 * 5. Excel-Type Filters for Receipts (Mode, Date, Amount)
 * 6. Renamed 'Principal Repayment' to 'Loan Repayment' everywhere
 * 7. Removed '12% P.A.', status is 'PENDING' until set-off
